{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All men and women who turn 20 must pass 10 tests in order to be recognized as official ninjas. Ayase Yui, who turned 20 this year, is considered inferior to her peers in terms of becoming an official ninja, which is why her face is always filled with discontent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is entirely up to you to break the prejudices of those around you and help Ayase Yui pass the ceremony with flying colors. Please cheer Ayase Yui on so that she can become a wonderful kunoichi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Flow:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain equipment through general battles and challenge the bosses guarding each gate. Pass through all 10 gates to complete the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle is a typical timing-based game where the slider handle located on the left side moves to the right, and when you press the space bar at the desired moment, the handle stops. If you are inside the enemy's territory at that moment, you successfully attack the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836970/extras/ffe2ed2497189f135906c959e1061809.avif?t=1761283243\" width=1600 height=898 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defense: When the handle reaches the right end and moves back to the left, if the handle stops within the enemy's territory, you can defend by deflecting the enemy's attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836970/extras/82268d9592414803133bce8e3747586b.avif?t=1761283243\" width=1600 height=894 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After winning a battle, select one of the three pieces of equipment, and it will be automatically equipped in the equipment window. Obtain equipment in this way and defeat the bosses guarding each gate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836970/extras/4e0575d5b84a1eba0c2684d36b286638.avif?t=1761283243\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shop, you can buy equipment items at random or purchase various skill scrolls to gain an advantage in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836970/extras/14c08b31e6c2196146a4470f099d0ec5.avif?t=1761283243\" width=1600 height=890 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the lounge, you can recover your stamina or enjoy games by betting your money. Of course, it's sad if you lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836970/extras/151a63033ec737371e83de4cccac6288.avif?t=1761283243\" width=1600 height=892 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836970/extras/35569fb089f0d1248cdd5acaa9dfa3e3.avif?t=1761283243\" width=1600 height=896 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836970/extras/63c9c455b4ebb214c6d0a414335896eb.avif?t=1761283243\" width=1600 height=896 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never die while playing! You just faint. In this case, you wake up again in the break room. However, there is a penalty where one of your equipment items disappears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, you can also enhance your items. Items can be enhanced up to level 10, so use enhancements to gain an advantage in battle. If you fail, you will lose gold, but your items will remain safe, so don't worry. The developers are generous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836970/extras/5d85339ba336abc0deffb0bda75c7527.avif?t=1761283243\" width=1600 height=916 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It may seem like a casual game, but I made it a little challenging. Please enjoy it, and if you find any bugs or areas for improvement, please let me know.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"boss1 Clear!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3836970/08409527e86124a98ae10ab223c8e582bb118064.jpg"},{"name":"boss2 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3836970/6a687c21565869f2b5873e80fd3b18503a278f88.jpg"},{"name":"boss3 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3836970/197d1834854806a5b5c6014f6d645e844b8b911b.jpg"},{"name":"boss4 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3836970/beee29f0777bfd0a3a382b01dc9e4c524414c6ef.jpg"},{"name":"boss5 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3836970/9efa87022a6bd8c19a2ca0fe4243c1100daa178e.jpg"},{"name":"boss6 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3836970/eda299cda8c1ee78b45c3ac05ec8281bb6f2c60b.jpg"},{"name":"boss7 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3836970/18c50faaae3078dd7cc32c8ad9d48704060399dd.jpg"},{"name":"boss8 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3836970/6e46856432928d08b8f203c97a4daebf2071e0d3.jpg"},{"name":"boss9 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3836970/cafd8f9b91f20bdefcb0c886f8cc71051604e6c2.jpg"},{"name":"boss10 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3836970/d5d66bfeb41e8d64460f8711261ce960662e9658.jpg"}],"total":45},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3836970?t=1761283243","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836970/117bcd9dfa835b20a89050889fa3e4dd6e9fc703/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761283243","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836970/2f50f8e65e008a2c7b7e1b401f5033caa8f49d7b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761283243","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836970/2f50f8e65e008a2c7b7e1b401f5033caa8f49d7b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761283243","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All men and women who turn 20 must pass 10 tests in order to be recognized as official ninjas. Ayase Yui, who turned 20 this year, is considered inferior to her peers in terms of becoming an official ninja, which is why her face is always filled with discontent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is entirely up to you to break the prejudices of those around you and help Ayase Yui pass the ceremony with flying colors. Please cheer Ayase Yui on so that she can become a wonderful kunoichi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Flow:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain equipment through general battles and challenge the bosses guarding each gate. Pass through all 10 gates to complete the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle is a typical timing-based game where the slider handle located on the left side moves to the right, and when you press the space bar at the desired moment, the handle stops. If you are inside the enemy's territory at that moment, you successfully attack the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836970/extras/ffe2ed2497189f135906c959e1061809.avif?t=1761283243\" width=1600 height=898 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defense: When the handle reaches the right end and moves back to the left, if the handle stops within the enemy's territory, you can defend by deflecting the enemy's attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836970/extras/82268d9592414803133bce8e3747586b.avif?t=1761283243\" width=1600 height=894 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After winning a battle, select one of the three pieces of equipment, and it will be automatically equipped in the equipment window. Obtain equipment in this way and defeat the bosses guarding each gate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836970/extras/4e0575d5b84a1eba0c2684d36b286638.avif?t=1761283243\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shop, you can buy equipment items at random or purchase various skill scrolls to gain an advantage in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836970/extras/14c08b31e6c2196146a4470f099d0ec5.avif?t=1761283243\" width=1600 height=890 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the lounge, you can recover your stamina or enjoy games by betting your money. Of course, it's sad if you lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836970/extras/151a63033ec737371e83de4cccac6288.avif?t=1761283243\" width=1600 height=892 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836970/extras/35569fb089f0d1248cdd5acaa9dfa3e3.avif?t=1761283243\" width=1600 height=896 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836970/extras/63c9c455b4ebb214c6d0a414335896eb.avif?t=1761283243\" width=1600 height=896 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never die while playing! You just faint. In this case, you wake up again in the break room. However, there is a penalty where one of your equipment items disappears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, you can also enhance your items. Items can be enhanced up to level 10, so use enhancements to gain an advantage in battle. If you fail, you will lose gold, but your items will remain safe, so don't worry. The developers are generous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836970/extras/5d85339ba336abc0deffb0bda75c7527.avif?t=1761283243\" width=1600 height=916 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It may seem like a casual game, but I made it a little challenging. Please enjoy it, and if you find any bugs or areas for improvement, please let me know.</p>","developers":["CodeBlues"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836970/9b0fdcd49d362509916fb444d5e2166cf8e686c9/header.jpg?t=1761283243","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3836970/1831868942/fcf1adf27b899eb88a180ea76c62964985f1aaf9/1759834815/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759835773","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3836970/1831868942/fcf1adf27b899eb88a180ea76c62964985f1aaf9/1759834815/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759835773","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3836970/1831868942/fcf1adf27b899eb88a180ea76c62964985f1aaf9/1759834815/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759835773","id":257213486,"name":"Game play version 1.31","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257213486/e20579821a6efceffbf769da1826ea6ad6fcd215/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759835773"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3836970/1698316599/a9a5a5943fce3214713da93ce8ef086bbf312464/1753074760/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753076441","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3836970/1698316599/a9a5a5943fce3214713da93ce8ef086bbf312464/1753074760/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753076441","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3836970/1698316599/a9a5a5943fce3214713da93ce8ef086bbf312464/1753074760/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753076441","id":257171261,"name":"Kunoichi Cadense Play","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257171261/e029a23b79a777a2512f0766f47a2f79eecdc760/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753076441"}],"name":"Kunoichi's Cadence","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default",